# GoldenEye XBLA: title -> solo -> Dam -> gameplay.
# START, A, A reach the mission page; the third A opens the difficulty list,
# whose cursor starts UNSET -- clamp it to the top with repeated DPAD_UP
# (deterministic: always lands on Agent), then A confirms and the pre-load
# BRIEFING appears (input-gated, stage still 90 here!). START on the briefing
# launches the mission -- THAT is when the stage global (0x82F1E704) flips --
# then the load runs and gameplay begins directly (no post-load screen).
# 4-poll holds -- 2-poll presses are too short for the menu debounce.
wait_polls 900
press START 4
wait_polls 300
press A 4
wait_polls 300
press A 4
wait_polls 300
press A 4
wait_polls 300
press DPAD_UP 4
wait_polls 60
press DPAD_UP 4
wait_polls 60
press DPAD_UP 4
wait_polls 60
press A 4
wait_polls 300
press START 4
wait_flag in_level 1 36000
wait_polls 120
